---
import SiteLayout from '../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro'
import katex from 'katex'

const architecture = katex.renderToString(
  String.raw`\mathcal C_{\mathrm{Car}}\xrightarrow{\mathsf K_s}\mathcal D_s\xrightarrow{\mathsf R_s}\mathcal O_s`,
  { displayMode: true, throwOnError: false },
)
const pairedRuntime = katex.renderToString(
  String.raw`\text{shared geometric microkernel}+\{(\text{coefficient system},\text{physical readout})_s\}`,
  { displayMode: true, throwOnError: false },
)
const resolvedActuality = katex.renderToString(
  String.raw`\text{resolved relational possibility}\longrightarrow\text{observable actuality}`,
  { displayMode: true, throwOnError: false },
)
const manifestationArchitecture = katex.renderToString(
  String.raw`\text{Carrier}+\text{sector coefficient}+\text{order-sensitive specialization}`,
  { displayMode: true, throwOnError: false },
)
---
<SiteLayout
  title="Speculations · Marici"
  description="Explicitly conjectural architectural interpretations suggested by Marici's established research record."
>
  <section class="section-shell" aria-labelledby="speculations-title">
    <header class="section-heading">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Speculations</p>
        <h1 id="speculations-title">Ideas worth sharpening, not results to inherit.</h1>
      </div>
      <p>
        This section records architectural interpretations suggested by the research program. Each
        speculation separates its evidence, conjectural step, falsifier, and prohibited overclaim.
        The <a href="/frontier/">Frontier Atlas</a>, epistemic graph, and Ledger remain the evidence-bearing records.
      </p>
    </header>

    <article class="frontier-card frontier-card--gap" aria-labelledby="microkernel-title">
      <header>
        <p>Speculation 01 · architectural analogy</p>
        <span>conjectural</span>
      </header>
      <h2 id="microkernel-title">One geometric microkernel, many typed runtimes</h2>
      <div class="formula" aria-label="Carrier to coefficient to observable architecture" set:html={architecture}></div>
      <p>
        The recurring carrier–coefficient–selection separation resembles a typed microkernel.
        The shared Carrier supplies a small calculus of legal incidence, degeneration, support,
        transport, and comparison operations. A sector contributes a coefficient system and a
        physical readout that together behave like a typed runtime and its interpreter.
      </p>
      <div class="formula" aria-label="Shared geometric microkernel plus sector runtime pairs" set:html={pairedRuntime}></div>
    </article>

    <div class="dimension-grid" aria-label="Status and tests for speculation 01">
      <section class="dimension-card">
        <p class="dimension-role">Established pressure</p>
        <h2>Three stages repeatedly separate</h2>
        <p>
          Across cosmology, flavor, strings, and radiative gravity, carrier incidence, coefficient
          classes, and physical activation cannot be substituted for one another. Nonzero internal
          data does not guarantee a physical observable.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="dimension-card">
        <p class="dimension-role">Conjectural step</p>
        <h2>The runtime may be the pair</h2>
        <p>
          A coefficient object may acquire its operational meaning only together with its allowed
          readout. The sector-specific unit could therefore be the pair
          <code>(coefficient system, physical readout)</code>, rather than either component alone.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="dimension-card">
        <p class="dimension-role">Sharp falsifiers</p>
        <h2>Break the shared kernel or split the pair</h2>
        <p>
          The analogy fails if a sector requires a structural operation not generated by the shared
          Carrier calculus. Its stronger paired-runtime form fails if a coefficient object has the
          same canonical operational meaning under genuinely different physical readouts.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="dimension-card">
        <p class="dimension-role">Non-claims</p>
        <h2>No literal software ontology</h2>
        <p>
          This does not claim that nature is software, that the Carrier is a computer, or that
          physical observers are forced by human perception to use one runtime. Those are separate
          hypotheses requiring independent evidence.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>

    <article class="frontier-card frontier-card--gap" aria-labelledby="actuality-title">
      <header>
        <p>Speculation 02 · metaphysical interpretation</p>
        <span>conjectural</span>
      </header>
      <h2 id="actuality-title">Actuality as a coarse image of resolved relational possibility</h2>
      <div class="formula" aria-label="Resolved relational possibility to observable actuality" set:html={resolvedActuality}></div>
      <p>
        The Carrier may be read as a grammar of possible relations: what can meet, factor,
        degenerate, vanish, or become a boundary. Sector coefficients supply distinct modes of
        content within that grammar, while specialization and physical readout determine what
        becomes observable. On this reading, an absent or vanishing observation need not imply
        the absence of all differentiating structure.
      </p>
      <div class="formula" aria-label="Carrier coefficient and specialization architecture" set:html={manifestationArchitecture}></div>
    </article>

    <div class="dimension-grid" aria-label="Status and tests for speculation 02">
      <section class="dimension-card">
        <p class="dimension-role">Established pressure</p>
        <h2>Coarse observables can erase resolved directions</h2>
        <p>
          In tested models, a first-order resolved coordinate can appear only quadratically in a
          coarse observable. Total energy behaves as a square-root modular coordinate, elliptic
          deformation begins beyond the first ordinary jet, and a quantum outcome amplitude of
          order <code>ε</code> produces probability and density of order <code>ε²</code> while its
          projective conditional direction survives.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="dimension-card">
        <p class="dimension-role">Conjectural step</p>
        <h2>Relations may precede manifested properties</h2>
        <p>
          Observable actuality may be a sector-dependent invariant of richer relational data.
          Exceptional and nearby-cycle information would then encode objective counterfactual
          structure: not another observed world, but how an observable regime can arise or vary.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="dimension-card">
        <p class="dimension-role">Sharp falsifiers</p>
        <h2>Demand recurrence and operational consequence</h2>
        <p>
          The interpretation weakens if resolved directions fail to recur across independently
          derived sectors, or if two distinct resolved directions can never produce distinct
          source-defined observables under any admissible continuation, conditioning, or
          specialization. A merely redundant parametrization carries no metaphysical weight.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="dimension-card">
        <p class="dimension-role">Non-claims</p>
        <h2>No proof of possible worlds or consciousness</h2>
        <p>
          This does not establish that possibilities are substances, that unobserved branches are
          separate worlds, that consciousness selects outcomes, or that the Carrier explains why
          anything exists. It is a disciplined interpretation of a repeated mathematical
          distinction, not an ontology forced by the present evidence.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>

    <section class="snapshot-callout" aria-labelledby="status-title">
      <p class="eyebrow">Epistemic boundary</p>
      <h2 id="status-title">Why keep this outside the Frontier Atlas?</h2>
      <p>
        The Atlas versions what the evidence currently supports. Speculations organize possible
        explanations of that evidence. A speculation may graduate only after its claimed functors,
        naturality squares, and falsifiers become source-typed tests.
      </p>
    </section>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
